WEBVTT

00:05:58.316 --> 00:06:01.476
and we must be big
when it comes to the impact we make.

00:06:01.516 --> 00:06:02.756
Thank you very much.

00:06:02.796 --> 00:06:04.436
(Applause)

00:06:14.236 --> 00:06:16.396
Bruno Giussani: First Minister, thank you.

00:06:16.396 --> 00:06:18.436
I would like to ask a couple of questions

00:06:18.436 --> 00:06:21.756
because you mentioned
the wind farms up north,

00:06:21.796 --> 00:06:24.316
but there is a new field
opening up in the north,

00:06:24.316 --> 00:06:26.476
it is an oil field, the Cambo oil field.

00:06:26.516 --> 00:06:29.196
It’s been licensed
by the UK government,

00:06:29.196 --> 00:06:31.596
and a few weeks ago
you wrote to the prime minister